      hu: ["Középkori stílusban tervezték.", "Nagy kertek veszik körül."],
      ro: ["Proiectat într-un stil medieval.", "Înconjurat de grădini mari."],
      en: ["Designed in a medieval style.", "Surrounded by large gardens."]
